      "date": "2025-10-14",
      "decision": "Implement layered context architecture (JSON + Markdown)",
      "rationale": "Claude Code needs machine-readable state (JSON) for fast parsing (~500 tokens) vs full strategic plan (7,000 tokens)",
      "impact": "90% reduction in session startup tokens (10,000 → 1,000), faster context loading, maintains human readability"
    },
    {
      "date": "2025-10-14",
      "decision": "Use permanent filenames for living documents",
      "rationale": "STRATEGIC-PLAN.md vs STRATEGIC-PLAN-2025-10-14.md - living documents evolve, date-stamping implies snapshots",
      "impact": "Easier to reference in /commands, clear which files update vs archive"
    },
    {
      "date": "2025-10-14",
